      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, can you help me draft a quick memo to our remote staff? basically just need to remind them about ergonomics and stuff like chair height and monitor levels so they dont get wrist or back pain. make it sound professional but not too stiff.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
